# Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.execution, attack.persistence, attack.initial-access, attack.stealth, attack.t1059.009, attack.t1078.004
# Description: Detects S3 Browser utility creating IAM User or AccessKey.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(eventSource == "iam.amazonaws.com" AND (eventName == "CreateUser" OR eventName == "CreateAccessKey") AND userAgent CONTAINS "S3 Browser")
